class: fax
detail: 256 895 4786
source: recordings/20260906T011417-sursum-corda-bell212a.wav, 4 s to 30 s
note: Sursum Corda's data/fax modem, after its data modes found nothing
  to talk to: ANSam, then T.30 CSI and DIS on V.21 channel 2 every five
  seconds.  The CSI carries the board's own number, sent backwards.
